# BossMeter_Defeated with no meter object (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (a boss's defeat:
# Op2_CallNative in its script, e.g. $0199FA): g_BossMeterObj 0, so it only clears g_BossEnergy
# and returns ($011B30), without the exit script or HUD_UnlockJoin. A real state: BossMeter_Show
# spawns the meter with Obj_SpawnEnemy (BossMeter_SpawnObject) and on a failed spawn returns the
# nonzero result without storing a handle (BossMeter_Spawn $011B04); the boss scripts call Show
# with Op2_CallNative, which ignores d0, so the fight goes on without a meter. The object pool
# does run out in real play (Obj_Spawn's failure `rts` $008F1C ran in the TAS and fuzz-73800-s2);
# no corpus boss met it at its Show.

case no_meter
w $FFFFED8A = 0
